            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Hangly 2.1.2</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Hangly opens at login again.</strong> Launch at login is now on by default for
      everyone. If you would rather start Hangly yourself, turn it off in Appearance, and it
      stays off.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
