            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Hangly 2.1.1</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Your setup comes back.</strong> After the Spider-Man entrance has shown itself
      off for two launches, every charm you had on the rope returns, in order and at its own
      size, with your rope style. Anything you chose meanwhile stays.</li>
  <li><strong>Quieter under the hood.</strong> Hangly now reports when an update arrives and
      installs, so problems with updates are noticed. Nothing personal is sent.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
